{"id":"83681d68660fc758","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-forcing10-iteration-support.md","title":"ZFC Forcing10 Iteration Support","display":"df-zfc-forcing10-iteration-support — ZFC Forcing10 Iteration Support","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing10-iteration-support","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing10-iteration-support"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing10-iteration-support — ZFC Forcing10 Iteration Support","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing10-iteration-support"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing10-iteration-support</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing10-iteration-support — ZFC Forcing10 Iteration Support"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,p,\\delta,\\vec{\\dot Q}\\in V\">\\(s,p,\\delta,\\vec{\\dot Q}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10IterationSupport}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10IterationSupport}_S\\)</span> (support predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10IterationSupport}_S(s,p,\\vec{\\dot Q},\\delta)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\land\\vec{\\dot Q}:\\delta\\to V\\land p:\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\to V\\land\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\subseteq\\delta\\land s=\\{\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\mid p(\\alpha)\\neq\\mathbf1_{\\dot Q_\\alpha}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10IterationSupport}_S(s,p,\\vec{\\dot Q},\\delta)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\land\\vec{\\dot Q}:\\delta\\to V\\land p:\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\to V\\land\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\subseteq\\delta\\land s=\\{\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\mid p(\\alpha)\\neq\\mathbf1_{\\dot Q_\\alpha}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The iterand sequence and condition are now required to be functions; previously only their domains were mentioned, so arbitrary relations could satisfy the formula.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":